 libadwaita-1-dev, libdrm-dev, libdisplay-info-dev, python3
Standards-Version: 4.7.3
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/ilya-zlobintsev/LACT

Package: lact
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd, polkitd | policykit-1
Recommends: vulkan-tools, clinfo
Description: Control, monitor and overclock a graphics card
 LACT reads and sets what the graphics driver exposes: clocks, voltages,
 power limits, fan curves and temperatures, for AMD cards through the amdgpu
 driver (and, in part, NVIDIA and Intel cards). A background service applies
 the settings the person saves, and a window and a command line change them.
 .
 The package is built from the release's source with its Rust crates vendored,
 not from upstream's prebuilt program, and nothing is installed under
 /usr/local. A copy installed by upstream's own makefile (/usr/local) is left
 as it is.
 .
 Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's edition of SparkyLinux (by Pawel "pavroo"
 Pijanowski). Upstream: Ilya Zlobintsev and the LACT contributors.
